```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Region
        subgraph AZ_A [Availability Zone A]
            EC2_A[EC2 Instance A]
            MT_A[EFS Mount Target A\nIP: 10.0.1.50]
            EC2_A -->|TCP 2049| MT_A
        end
        
        subgraph AZ_B [Availability Zone B]
            EC2_B[EC2 Instance B]
            MT_B[EFS Mount Target B\nIP: 10.0.2.50]
            EC2_B -->|TCP 2049| MT_B
        end
        
        MT_A --- EFS_Core[(EFS Managed Storage Core)]
        MT_B --- EFS_Core
    end
```
